{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8fd26523c34b78ec278bb8c4e0544b8b3bf3cf13671c3d4f71598c5ed3ce0df6", "ja": "（TV番組で、和太鼓を披露することになった。\n本番に向けて、今日は静香と太鼓の特訓だ！）", "zh": "（决定要在电视节目上表演和太鼓。为了正式演出，今天要和静香特训太鼓！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "89ed0fbb147b68d69124c6cd036b4c8a6968c271b1275d16c5cb619d75c01238", "ja": "ふぅ……{$P$}、どうでしたか？\n今のは、結構自信あったんですけど。", "zh": "呼……{$P$}，您觉得怎么样？\n刚才那段，我还是挺有自信的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8091354a1610f0854369a5dab05440dc1abb3456c1b6ebbc52164a1e59bcd90b", "ja": "うん、よかったぞ！　この前のリハより\n上達してるみたいだけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "嗯，表现得很不错！好像比上次彩排进步了不少，是遇到什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "dccdaca2f62822f7e21f225d4c334a1d20d16d3bd44f18c05a7a1e5b07e6df43", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます。\nやっぱり、意識を変えたのが正解だったのかな。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢。\n看来改变了想法是正确的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2eb678b9c5ce686e1778ca4247dd64c174c20983121d8a88e9fbfa1b86c5047a", "ja": "意識を変えた、って？", "zh": "改变了想法，是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "9741f0ac3f63ec269d1b7d24bf52da2a201dc9bceab08b4a9d06882d91096cc6", "ja": "あ、はい。私、和太鼓の演奏動画を見て、\n研究したりとか、してたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，是的。我看了些和太鼓演奏的视频，也做了些研究……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "585b9a5a4d8762fa68ec4111d73350796f395d2a4d447c73f4ce2219b914f368", "ja": "その時、上手な人の共通点って何だろうって、\nふと思って……そしたら、気づいたんです。", "zh": "那时候，我突然想到，擅长的人有什么共同点呢……然后，我发现了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "91c61d7b1b5ca4f2bc3ebdb91da395ea954820cfcf94cd4f87aae4e7924022d8", "ja": "上手な人はみんな、楽しそうに叩いてるなって。だから\n見てるこっちも、楽しい気持ちになるのかなって。", "zh": "技术好的人，个个都敲得很开心。所以看着他们的我们，也会跟着感到快乐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1008_p", "source_sha256": "41454332bf1e98a7976897a74203bf986dba9ebcb7aa334447bc7b91f02ef29f", "ja": "それで、楽しんで叩くようにしたってことか。\n確かに今日は、前より笑顔が多かった気がするよ。", "zh": "所以，你才开始带着享受的心情去打鼓了啊。\n确实，我感觉你今天比以前笑得更多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "28bc64f5c78d30a5aa7a4fa0369335cb0d215e37d0f57b5e1754e6544ff6b227", "ja": "はい！　もちろん正確に叩く事も大切ですけど。\nそれだけじゃ意味がないってわかったんです。", "zh": "是的！当然，准确敲击也很重要。\n但我明白了，光是做到这一点是没有意义的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "f51ccb1906852d6184bd4c57960d76fd8bc97fcbf9e7b013760874d069c96841", "ja": "今日はなにより、楽しむことを第一に考えました。\nそのおかげで、勢いに乗れた気がします。", "zh": "今天最重要的是，我把享受其中放在了第一位。\n多亏了这一点，我感觉自己也找到了节奏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dc31bf427e75eb6906c7b8f6b0af6d49997afcf7cf5a1cbc16272a169025158a", "ja": "ああ、作戦は大成功だな！\n見違えるほど上手くなったと思うよ。", "zh": "啊，作战大获成功啊！\n我觉得你进步得简直判若两人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "e26983254da262ba69ce74f04654866b4994291e21495b64bfb0c97916824e2d", "ja": "ふふっ。途中{$P$}、ノリノリ\nでしたよね？　リズムに合わせて動いたりとか。", "zh": "呵呵。刚才{$P$}，不是特别起劲吗？还跟着节奏动来动去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b53007718f645c3444ebb334e7ddc34223eca35ff36ef6d695e7eb57ecafe360", "ja": "え？　そんな……乗ってたか？\n全然意識してなかったけど……。", "zh": "诶？有吗……我有跟着节奏吗？\n完全没意识到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "72b2e5cbcdf008b3c2ec97e9093e14ecd1af588e201fb82ca47c6925187efd73", "ja": "ノってましたよ！\nおかげで自信が持てました。ふふっ。", "zh": "您刚才很有气势哦！\n多亏了您，我也有信心了。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0293_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "b768b10816f0f4a2d37b305d7852c013b69d8a47b2fa181d264111d3cf8f520c", "ja": "本番も、ノリノリにさせちゃいますから。\n楽しみにしててくださいね、{$P$}！", "zh": "正式演出时，也会让您嗨起来的。请期待吧，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
